WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.536
-The President's path
to re-election is narrowing

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.739
as the remaining swing states
continue counting ballots.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.673
So now his team is trying
a new strategy --

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:10.910
keep counting Trump votes,
but stop counting Biden votes.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.146
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:16.915
♪♪

00:00:16.915 --> 00:00:19.118
It's worth noting that we tape
our show at 5:00 P.M.

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:20.686
so we don't know if there's
going to be

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.088
a call tonight or not.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.023
But things are looking pretty
good for Joe Biden.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:26.592
But Donald Trump, political
mastermind that he is,

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:28.360
has discovered a hack.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.496
Just declare the states
you want to win

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:32.832
and claim victory
without evidence.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.334
-He said, quote,
"We have claimed

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.901
for electoral vote purposes

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:37.403
the Commonwealth
of Pennsylvania,

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:39.605
which won't allow
legal observers,

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:41.975
the state of Georgia, and the
state of North Carolina,

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:44.743
each one of which has
a big Trump lead.

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:47.046
Additionally, we hereby claim
the state of Michigan

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:49.115
if, in fact,
there was a large number

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:52.952
of secretly dumped ballots as
has been widely reported."

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:55.221
-I love when Trump tries to
write something in legalese

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.590
and ends up sounding like
Bill and Ted arguing over

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.392
who gets shotgun in a car.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:03.196
"I hereby claim the front seat
for the ride to White Castle."

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:07.166
"Ah, but as you can see, my hand
has heretofore been placed

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.035
upon the exterior of
the vehicle,

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:12.371
therefore negating your verbal
declaration of shotgun,

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:15.475
and thus, your claim must be
withdrawn forthwith."

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.643
Also, I love that Trump
thinks using the word "hereby"

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.845
makes his tweet an official
legal document.

00:01:19.845 --> 00:01:21.614
The guy's spent most of his life
in court,

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.283
and that's the only
thing he learned.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:24.817
[ As Trump ] "If anyone's
giving you trouble,

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:27.553
just throw in a 'hereby.'
nobody comes back from that."

00:01:27.553 --> 00:01:29.788
And it wasn't just Trump.
Everyone in and around

00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:31.858
his campaign, from his weird
adult sons,

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:34.627
to his campaign manager,
tried to just claim victory

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.562
in Pennsylvania without
any evidence

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:37.997
before the votes
had been counted.

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:40.266
-White House Spokesperson
Kayleigh McEnany tweeted,

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.402
"Victory for President
in Pennsylvania."

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.336
-We've declared victory
in Pennsylvania.

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:47.740
-We are declaring a victory
in Pennsylvania.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.343
-Oh, you're declaring
victory in Pennsylvania?

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:52.178
Okay.
Well, I'm declaring myself

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.679
King of the Andals
and the First Men,

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:55.881
Lord of the Seven Kingdoms,
and Protector of the Realm

00:01:55.881 --> 00:01:58.484
and my first official act is
not sending that dragon

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.920
to fight the Night King.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:04.557
Also, can someone tell me again
how Bran got elected?

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:06.425
Did Westeros also have
an electoral college?

00:02:06.425 --> 00:02:09.294
Were there a lot of Bran fans
in Maricopa County?

00:02:09.294 --> 00:02:12.865
"And again, you have to
remember, we expect Maricopa

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:15.034
to break late for Bran."

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:17.069
Anyway, the point is, you don't
just get to declare victory

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:18.938
in any state, and no one cares
that you did.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:21.173
I mean, I guess we have to care
a little bit

00:02:21.173 --> 00:02:22.908
because you're the President,
and you wield

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:24.276
an insane amount of power.

00:02:24.276 --> 00:02:26.746
But ideally, you know, we'd just
ignore you.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.481
When someone gets on the subway
and declares themself

00:02:29.481 --> 00:02:31.751
king of the F Train
and demands tribute,

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:34.186
you don't stand up and start
arguing with them, saying,

00:02:34.186 --> 00:02:35.921
"Actually, according
to MTA bylaws,

00:02:35.921 --> 00:02:37.256
none of the trains
have monarchs."

00:02:37.256 --> 00:02:39.592
You just turn up the volume
on your AirPods.

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:42.461
No one's buying these false
declarations of victory,

00:02:42.461 --> 00:02:44.497
in part because even
the Trump team

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.265
can't keep their bull [bleep]
straight.

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:48.067
In Pennsylvania, they want to
stop the count

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:49.301
while they're ahead.

00:02:49.301 --> 00:02:51.237
In Arizona, however,
they're suddenly concerned

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.439
that the counting will stop
while they're behind.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:55.408
If you thought Trump ghouls
have plumbed the depths

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:56.976
of their shamelessness,
think again,

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:59.812
because here's Kellyanne Conway
and Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:01.781
on Fox News this morning
claiming that

00:03:01.781 --> 00:03:04.016
when it comes to states
Trump is losing,

00:03:04.016 --> 00:03:05.350
we should take our time,

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:07.820
after months of insisting
ballots should not be counted

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.255
after election day.
-Arizona and Pennsylvania,

00:03:10.255 --> 00:03:12.058
I think, are key
for the President.

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:16.596
And those are both places where
he still has a path to victory.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:20.333
And so I think it is incredibly
too early

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:23.169
for them to make that
type of announcement,

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:25.304
because we've still got votes
left to be counted

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:28.808
and I think that has to be
completed before we can

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:30.343
determine who the winner is.

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:33.479
-We spent three years --
they spent three years

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.781
investigating the President,
impeaching the President.

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:38.851
We can't wait three hours,
three days, three weeks

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:41.087
to get a result in our great
sturdy democracy

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:42.821
as to whom the next
President will be?

00:03:42.821 --> 00:03:44.657
I mean, what is the rush?

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.492
-Yeah, what's the rush?
Let's take our time!

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:49.361
Three hours, three days,
three weeks, three years!

00:03:49.361 --> 00:03:50.863
Let's take our time
to figure this out,

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.598
because if Donald Trump is known
for one thing,

00:03:52.598 --> 00:03:53.766
it's patience.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:55.267
Trump is the least patient
man alive.

00:03:55.267 --> 00:03:57.303
You can tell because even
when he's standing still,

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:59.305
he sways back and forth
like a fourth grader

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:01.007
posing for a school photo.

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:03.176
"I mean, is your bladder full?
Is you have to go, go."

00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:06.078
We're going to find out years
later that Trump held it in

00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:07.813
the whole time
he was in office.

00:04:07.813 --> 00:04:10.116
"I can only go in my gold toilet
at home."

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:12.385
That's right. After months
of claiming any delay

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.420
in counting would be suspicious,

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.054
and they wanted all
the votes counted and declared

00:04:16.054 --> 00:04:18.757
on election night, now they want
us all to take our time

00:04:18.757 --> 00:04:21.227
and make sure every vote
is counted, which is correct.

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:24.397
We agree.
Count every vote, everywhere.

00:04:24.397 --> 00:04:26.698
In reality, of course, they'll
just switch to whatever position

00:04:26.698 --> 00:04:28.334
suits their political interest.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:30.269
Next, they're gonna argue we
should wait four years to count

00:04:30.269 --> 00:04:32.938
and let Trump crash with Joe at
the White House in the meantime.

00:04:32.938 --> 00:04:34.640
"We're out of toilet paper,
Joe."

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.042
[ As Biden ] "It's noon.

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:37.576
What are you doing out here
in your bath robe?"

00:04:37.576 --> 00:04:39.678
"I was watching Fox News.
They think you stink."

00:04:39.678 --> 00:04:41.146
"I'm trying to work here."

00:04:41.146 --> 00:04:45.051
"Yeah, I had this job.
It's the worst."

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:47.620
You almost got to applaud their
ability to pivot on a dime

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.922
from one brazen lie to another
contradictory lie.

00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:51.491
But hey, you heard it.

00:04:51.491 --> 00:04:54.159
The President's closest and most
trusted advisers,

00:04:54.159 --> 00:04:56.495
let's take our time
and count all the votes,

00:04:56.495 --> 00:04:57.830
and we agree --

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.333
count every vote,
in every state, everywhere.

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.967
I am so glad that's settled.

00:05:01.967 --> 00:05:04.003
[ Typing ]
Oh. Oh my God. That's weird.

00:05:04.003 --> 00:05:05.471
Okay, I hear typing.

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.673
Almost as if someone is angrily
tweeting, misspelling it,

00:05:07.673 --> 00:05:09.108
and then tweeting it again.

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:11.644
-President Trump there
tweeted, "Stop the count."

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:15.548
-Oh, no! But what about
Kellyanne Conway's credibility?

00:05:15.548 --> 00:05:18.317
How will we ever believe
anything she says ever again?

00:05:18.317 --> 00:05:20.219
That tweet came like an hour

00:05:20.219 --> 00:05:22.888
after Conway and the other Trump
hacks were all over Fox News

00:05:22.888 --> 00:05:24.656
claiming that actually
we need to keep

00:05:24.656 --> 00:05:26.191
counting all the ballots.

00:05:26.191 --> 00:05:28.126
Trying to stay on message
with Trump is like

00:05:28.126 --> 00:05:31.030
trying to ride a mechanical bull
slathered in olive oil.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:33.566
And then again, today, Trump
tried to use his magical powers

00:05:33.566 --> 00:05:36.802
of tweeting to declare, without
any basis in law whatsoever,

00:05:36.802 --> 00:05:39.405
that ballots postmarked by
election day,

00:05:39.405 --> 00:05:41.807
but received after election day
should not be counted.

00:05:41.807 --> 00:05:43.175
And once again, as they've done

00:05:43.175 --> 00:05:44.777
with many of his
deranged tweets,

00:05:44.777 --> 00:05:46.778
Twitter censored it
because it was a lie.

00:05:46.778 --> 00:05:49.548
-Mail-in ballot counting
continues in Philadelphia,

00:05:49.548 --> 00:05:53.118
despite President Trump's tweet
saying, "Any vote that came in

00:05:53.118 --> 00:05:56.088
after election day
will not be counted."

00:05:56.088 --> 00:05:58.357
-Sorry, bud,
that's not up to you.

00:05:58.357 --> 00:06:00.793
That's like me saying, "Any
writer who leaves before 5:00

00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:03.195
will not be paid."
I mean, they all do it anyway.

00:06:03.195 --> 00:06:05.664
At least the ones who are sober
enough to make it to the subway.

00:06:05.664 --> 00:06:07.166
True story, my writers
don't even know

00:06:07.166 --> 00:06:08.767
we do interviews on this show.

00:06:08.767 --> 00:06:10.803
But I have to say,
it will be fun to see

00:06:10.803 --> 00:06:13.105
if Trump keeps trying
his magic Twitter powers

00:06:13.105 --> 00:06:14.473
after he leaves office.

00:06:14.473 --> 00:06:17.476
"Any guac added at Chipotle
will be free of charge!"

00:06:17.476 --> 00:06:19.578
There are many states,
including swing states,

00:06:19.578 --> 00:06:21.480
where as long as
your ballot is postmarked

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:25.251
on or before the election,
it can be counted afterward.

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:27.053
Those states include
Pennsylvania and North Carolina,

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:30.022
but there are also a bunch
of heavily Republican states

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:33.092
that do the same thing, like
Mississippi, North Dakota,

00:06:33.092 --> 00:06:35.928
Iowa, Texas, Ohio,
West Virginia,

00:06:35.928 --> 00:06:37.530
Utah, and Alaska.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:39.331
Of course, in Alaska they have
to give you extra time,

00:06:39.331 --> 00:06:41.133
because the mail there is
delivered via malamute.

00:06:41.133 --> 00:06:42.869
And this is a real tangent,
but all day long I've read

00:06:42.869 --> 00:06:44.403
that line and thought
it should be a lyric

00:06:44.403 --> 00:06:45.704
in a Beastie Boys song.

00:06:45.704 --> 00:06:48.574
♪ I get all my mail
delivered by a malamute ♪

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.112
Also, I gotta say that it's so
great Trump is spending

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:54.579
the days after the election
with basically

00:06:54.579 --> 00:06:56.215
his entire Twitter feed
censored.

00:06:56.215 --> 00:06:58.584
It's like taking away
Zorro's sword.

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:00.352
Without it, he's just
a creepy dude

00:07:00.352 --> 00:07:01.720
with a mustache
and a cape.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.622
"Yeah, Officer, I'd like to
report a weird man

00:07:03.622 --> 00:07:06.826
who just fogged up my window
and drew a 'Z' with his finger."

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:08.894
I wish we could slap the Twitter
warning label

00:07:08.894 --> 00:07:10.930
on Trump's mouth
whenever he talks.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:14.833
[ No Audio ]

00:07:14.833 --> 00:07:17.270
To be clear, there's no
evidence for fraud anywhere.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:20.039
The best they can come up with
is a dumb and obviously fake

00:07:20.039 --> 00:07:23.876
Internet rumor claiming Arizona
officials duped Trump voters

00:07:23.876 --> 00:07:26.145
into filling out ballots
with Sharpie,

00:07:26.145 --> 00:07:29.448
knowing that Sharpie would be
disqualified, which it's not.

00:07:29.448 --> 00:07:31.517
"Allies of President Trump
are promoting a baseless

00:07:31.517 --> 00:07:34.219
conspiracy theory that poll
workers tricked Trump voters

00:07:34.219 --> 00:07:36.222
by providing them with Sharpies
to cast their votes

00:07:36.222 --> 00:07:39.024
and then rejected the ballots
due to the use of the marker."

00:07:39.024 --> 00:07:40.926
It must be so hard for the Trump
administration to pretend

00:07:40.926 --> 00:07:42.361
to be anti-Sharpie.

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:44.697
It's what he used to white his
inauguration speech.

00:07:44.697 --> 00:07:48.167
It's also what he uses to sign
boobs and control the weather.

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:50.002
I'm pretty sure it's what
Rudy uses to get hyped up

00:07:50.002 --> 00:07:52.438
for his Fox appearances.

00:07:52.438 --> 00:07:54.907
Second, my favorite thing about
this is even their best attempt

00:07:54.907 --> 00:07:56.608
at claiming fraud involves
admitting that they're

00:07:56.608 --> 00:07:58.945
easily tricked doofuses.

00:07:58.945 --> 00:08:00.846
What happened?
Did a guy in a white van pull up

00:08:00.846 --> 00:08:03.548
and say, "Hey, you going to vote
for President?

00:08:03.548 --> 00:08:06.752
You wanna do it with a Sharpie?

00:08:06.752 --> 00:08:10.388
Ooh, you using a pen, square?"

00:08:10.388 --> 00:08:12.491
There's no evidence of fraud
in Pennsylvania either,

00:08:12.491 --> 00:08:15.161
where they're literally just
counting the ballots

00:08:15.161 --> 00:08:18.297
that have been legitimately
cast, as they always do.

00:08:18.297 --> 00:08:20.966
And you can tell even the Trump
team is struggling to keep up

00:08:20.966 --> 00:08:23.002
this line of BS because
they're getting challenged

00:08:23.002 --> 00:08:25.338
on their favorite TV channel,
Fox News,

00:08:25.338 --> 00:08:27.372
as White House Press Secretary
Kayleigh McEnany

00:08:27.372 --> 00:08:28.940
discovered on Wednesday.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.344
-We have election days in this
country for a reason.

00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:33.679
It's because votes are counted
on election day.

00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:35.547
So we are fighting for the
American people to know

00:08:35.547 --> 00:08:37.216
sooner rather than later.

00:08:37.216 --> 00:08:38.918
We want the votes to be counted.
-But Kayleigh, we always

00:08:38.918 --> 00:08:40.719
have had provisional ballots
and military ballots

00:08:40.719 --> 00:08:42.555
that get counted later.

00:08:42.555 --> 00:08:45.791
The votes have to be in
by November 3rd,

00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:47.592
that was what their
state legislature

00:08:47.592 --> 00:08:48.761
and their court system --

00:08:48.761 --> 00:08:50.195
-Postmarked.
-...agreed to,

00:08:50.195 --> 00:08:51.764
that it had to be
postmarked by November 3rd

00:08:51.764 --> 00:08:53.065
and then counted.

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:55.100
So the voting is happening
on election day.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.369
-And the legislature, you're
right, determines the time,

00:08:57.369 --> 00:08:59.771
the manner and the place
in which an election happens.

00:08:59.771 --> 00:09:02.574
We believe every vote on
election day should be counted.

00:09:02.574 --> 00:09:05.077
But it's those that arrive after
the election day

00:09:05.077 --> 00:09:06.945
that we are fighting in court.
-Even if they already voted

00:09:06.945 --> 00:09:09.381
on November 3rd,
which is the postmark?

00:09:09.381 --> 00:09:11.984
-We are fighting for those
that are after November 3rd.

00:09:11.984 --> 00:09:13.986
We want election day ballots
to be counted.

00:09:13.986 --> 00:09:17.590
-♪ Yeah, and I got more lies
than Kayleigh McEnany ♪

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.391
[ Laughter ]

00:09:19.391 --> 00:09:21.226
First of all, I love
how her only move is

00:09:21.226 --> 00:09:22.795
to just keep nodding her head,

00:09:22.795 --> 00:09:24.563
even while she's being
fact checked,

00:09:24.563 --> 00:09:26.432
as if the anchors
disproving her lies

00:09:26.432 --> 00:09:27.833
are actually agreeing
with her.

00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:30.235
It's like watching a drunk
person argue with a cop.

00:09:30.235 --> 00:09:32.605
"Ma'am, did you know you were
swerving between lanes?"

00:09:32.605 --> 00:09:35.440
"Yes, yes, Officer,
I was changing lanes."

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:36.742
"You almost hit a tree, ma'am."

00:09:36.742 --> 00:09:39.578
"Yes. Yeah, I was trying to
park in the woods."

00:09:39.578 --> 00:09:41.513
The Trump campaign is desperate
to manufacture

00:09:41.513 --> 00:09:43.949
some non-existent fraud in order
to steal the election,

00:09:43.949 --> 00:09:46.685
so they sent their best man
to Philadelphia,

00:09:46.685 --> 00:09:49.888
the Italian Ziggy,
Rudy Giuliani.

00:09:49.888 --> 00:09:52.291
Rudy held a press conference
in Philadelphia yesterday

00:09:52.291 --> 00:09:53.960
where he claimed,
with zero evidence,

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.196
there was fraud happening,
and that Democrats were somehow

00:09:57.196 --> 00:10:00.098
stealing the election by, again,
just counting the votes.

00:10:00.098 --> 00:10:02.167
-How many votes
do we have to be ahead?

00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:04.837
400,000's not enough?

00:10:04.837 --> 00:10:07.840
With 80-plus percent counted?

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:11.277
I think there's only 14%
of the vote to go.

00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:14.312
Do you think we're stupid?
Do you think we're fools?

00:10:14.312 --> 00:10:15.981
-Uh, yeah.

00:10:15.981 --> 00:10:17.649
Hard yes on both counts.

00:10:17.649 --> 00:10:19.685
It's like when a metal band
takes the stage

00:10:19.685 --> 00:10:21.153
and asks if
you're ready to rock.

00:10:21.153 --> 00:10:22.421
You don't really have to ask.

00:10:22.421 --> 00:10:24.156
I wouldn't have bought
Megadeth tickets

00:10:24.156 --> 00:10:26.725
if I was looking for a quiet
night of reflection, man.

00:10:26.725 --> 00:10:29.161
No offense, Rudy, but I don't
trust you to tell us

00:10:29.161 --> 00:10:30.896
who's up and who's down,
since you don't know

00:10:30.896 --> 00:10:32.764
the difference between
up and down.

00:10:32.764 --> 00:10:36.835
-From the top to the bottom,
from the middle to the side.

00:10:36.835 --> 00:10:39.505
-Can you imagine
how confusing it must be

00:10:39.505 --> 00:10:41.106
when he reports back to Trump?

00:10:41.106 --> 00:10:44.710
"Great news, Donald, you're up
here, while Biden's down here.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:46.812
Now if you need me, I'll be
in the middle."

00:10:46.812 --> 00:10:48.914
Seriously, Rudy, it might be
time to pack it in.

00:10:48.914 --> 00:10:51.049
Or, in your case, tuck it in.

00:10:51.049 --> 00:10:53.885
Man, every time Rudy sees
that clip, he must think,

00:10:53.885 --> 00:10:55.688
[ As Borat ]
"[Bleep] my life!"

00:10:55.688 --> 00:10:58.290
[ Laughter ]

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.658
That was for Shoemaker.

00:10:59.658 --> 00:11:01.059
You know the funny thing
about Shoemaker,

00:11:01.059 --> 00:11:02.594
he doesn't like Borat,
he just likes when

00:11:02.594 --> 00:11:05.197
people do the impression.
[ Laughter ]

00:11:05.197 --> 00:11:07.366
Again, Rudy just made up
a bunch of lies

00:11:07.366 --> 00:11:09.935
without any evidence at all.
He claimed mail-in ballots,

00:11:09.935 --> 00:11:11.737
which we've been counting
since the Civil War,

00:11:11.737 --> 00:11:13.772
were a new thing
and somehow fraudulent,

00:11:13.772 --> 00:11:16.274
that voters were being bussed in
from other states,

00:11:16.274 --> 00:11:18.610
that Joe Biden himself
somehow voted 50 times,

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.512
and even that dead people
might be voting.

00:11:20.512 --> 00:11:22.247
-This whole new thing that never
happened before

00:11:22.247 --> 00:11:25.183
in our country,
these mail-in ballots,

00:11:25.183 --> 00:11:28.087
which has been a cause of real
concern for everyone,

00:11:28.087 --> 00:11:30.823
because they can easily
be fraudulent.

00:11:30.823 --> 00:11:33.158
And you have a reputation
of people being bussed in

00:11:33.158 --> 00:11:35.527
from Camden voting here.

00:11:35.527 --> 00:11:37.262
Wouldn't be the first time
that happened.

00:11:37.262 --> 00:11:39.898
Joe Biden could have voted
50 times as far as we know,

00:11:39.898 --> 00:11:41.567
or 5,000 times.

00:11:41.567 --> 00:11:43.668
Philadelphia, unfortunately,
and I would say this

00:11:43.668 --> 00:11:46.771
about my own city, has
a reputation for voter fraud.

00:11:46.771 --> 00:11:49.241
You have a reputation
for dead people voting.

00:11:49.241 --> 00:11:51.743
And we're gonna go look at just
how many dead people voted here.

00:11:51.743 --> 00:11:54.746
-Of course Rudy thinks
dead people voted. He voted.

00:11:54.746 --> 00:11:56.882
"We have proof that
dead people are voting.

00:11:56.882 --> 00:11:59.451
I just went to a polling place
yesterday, and they let me in,

00:11:59.451 --> 00:12:02.354
even after I blew a zero
on the thermometer.

00:12:02.354 --> 00:12:05.757
And we need voter I.D. laws,
nobody even checked my toe tag."

00:12:05.757 --> 00:12:07.693
How are you gonna look at
how many dead people voted?

00:12:07.693 --> 00:12:09.794
Are you gonna go to the morgue
and see if any of the corpses

00:12:09.794 --> 00:12:10.996
are wearing stickers?

00:12:10.996 --> 00:12:12.531
"Boss, I found another one."

00:12:12.531 --> 00:12:14.032
All of this is so dumb
and transparent,

00:12:14.032 --> 00:12:15.601
but unfortunately,
it has consequences.

00:12:15.601 --> 00:12:17.068
Trump supporters
believe this stuff,

00:12:17.068 --> 00:12:19.271
which is why one of them
crashed a press conference

00:12:19.271 --> 00:12:21.773
in Nevada yesterday screaming
that Joe Biden

00:12:21.773 --> 00:12:23.342
was stealing the election.

00:12:23.342 --> 00:12:24.943
-As I mentioned,
we are not prepared

00:12:24.943 --> 00:12:26.211
to give that number now.

00:12:26.211 --> 00:12:28.513
-The Biden crime family is
stealing the election!

00:12:28.513 --> 00:12:30.115
The media is covering up!

00:12:30.115 --> 00:12:32.585
The Biden crime family is
stealing this election!

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:34.286
The media is covering it up!

00:12:34.286 --> 00:12:36.789
The Biden crime family's
stealing this election!

00:12:36.789 --> 00:12:38.223
The media's covering it up.

00:12:38.223 --> 00:12:39.958
We want our freedom
for the world!

00:12:39.958 --> 00:12:41.794
Give us our freedom, Joe Biden!

00:12:41.794 --> 00:12:44.929
Biden's covering up this
election, he's stealing it!

00:12:44.929 --> 00:12:46.799
[ Camera shutters click ]

00:12:48.934 --> 00:12:50.936
-Where were we?
What was the last question?

00:12:50.936 --> 00:12:53.272
-I mean, that's fantastic
how he finishes screaming

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:55.173
and just walks away like a guy

00:12:55.173 --> 00:12:57.009
complaining about his order
at the deli.

00:12:57.009 --> 00:13:00.679
"I said, 'No mustard!'
no mustard!'"

00:13:00.679 --> 00:13:03.782
[ Laughter ]

00:13:03.782 --> 00:13:06.118
It's so hard to take your claims
of voter fraud seriously

00:13:06.118 --> 00:13:08.052
when you're wearing a tank top
that looks like you won it

00:13:08.052 --> 00:13:09.788
in a wing-eating contest.

00:13:09.788 --> 00:13:11.590
You're not allowed to make
legal claims

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:13.425
when you're not
wearing sleeves.

00:13:13.425 --> 00:13:15.194
"And can we assume you're
from the law firm

00:13:15.194 --> 00:13:16.862
of Barbecue, Beer,
and Freedom?"

00:13:16.862 --> 00:13:19.965
"Oh, it's actually Barbecue,
Beer, Freedom, and Leibowitz."

00:13:19.965 --> 00:13:21.700
I mean, look at your outfit.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.069
You look like Mike Scollins
in a Zoom meeting.

00:13:24.069 --> 00:13:25.638
[ Laughter ]

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:27.806
That joke made my
writing staff very happy.

00:13:27.806 --> 00:13:30.842
Well, almost all of them.

00:13:30.842 --> 00:13:33.412
So Trump, Kellyanne Conway,
Sarah Huckabee Sanders,

00:13:33.412 --> 00:13:35.214
Kayleigh McEnany, Rudy Giuliani,

00:13:35.214 --> 00:13:36.515
none of them keep
their stories straight,

00:13:36.515 --> 00:13:38.183
which is why even the crowds
of Trump supporters

00:13:38.183 --> 00:13:40.119
harassing and intimidating
poll workers

00:13:40.119 --> 00:13:41.854
can't keep their stories
straight either.

00:13:41.854 --> 00:13:43.655
In Michigan, where Trump
started out ahead,

00:13:43.655 --> 00:13:45.724
they called on poll workers
to stop counting votes.

00:13:45.724 --> 00:13:47.726
But in Arizona, where Trump
is behind,

00:13:47.726 --> 00:13:49.128
they called for the opposite.

00:14:00.505 --> 00:14:02.674
-Truly, we are
a nation divided.

00:14:02.674 --> 00:14:04.009
I don't think Trump voters

00:14:04.009 --> 00:14:05.477
actually know
what they're chanting.

00:14:05.477 --> 00:14:07.146
I just think they love to chant.

00:14:07.146 --> 00:14:08.847
"Build that wall."
"Lock 'em up."

00:14:08.847 --> 00:14:10.983
"Count the votes."
"Stop the count."

00:14:10.983 --> 00:14:14.786
It doesn't actually matter, they
just love three-word phrases.

00:14:14.786 --> 00:14:17.589
If we could just send in the
Barbecue, Beer, and Freedom guy

00:14:17.589 --> 00:14:19.458
and have him do a keg stand,
they'd quickly switch

00:14:19.458 --> 00:14:21.960
to chanting, "Drink that beer!
Drink that beer!"

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.829
Personally, I think
the best chance we have

00:14:23.829 --> 00:14:25.364
for distracting
these Trump supporters

00:14:25.364 --> 00:14:27.699
and keeping them away from poll
workers is to just sic them

00:14:27.699 --> 00:14:29.968
on each other and let them
shout back and forth.

00:14:29.968 --> 00:14:31.403
-Stop the count.

00:14:31.403 --> 00:14:32.905
-Count those votes.

00:14:32.905 --> 00:14:34.606
-Stop the count.

00:14:34.606 --> 00:14:36.074
-Count the votes.

00:14:36.074 --> 00:14:39.010
-Stop the count.
-Count those votes.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.346
-And then we can just
leave them there

00:14:40.346 --> 00:14:41.647
to yell at each other
for four years

00:14:41.647 --> 00:14:43.048
while the rest of us
get on with our lives.

00:14:43.048 --> 00:14:44.816
This is a dangerous moment.

00:14:44.816 --> 00:14:47.252
The President and his supporters
telegraphed for weeks

00:14:47.252 --> 00:14:49.054
that they would try
to steal the election,

00:14:49.054 --> 00:14:51.256
and now they're doing it.
We can't let them.

00:14:51.256 --> 00:14:55.293
We have to count every ballot,
in every state, everywhere...

00:14:55.293 --> 00:14:59.164
-From the top to the bottom,
from the middle to the side.

00:14:59.164 --> 00:15:00.799
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:15:00.799 --> 00:15:04.269
♪♪

